  "title": "Pauline Werner's Beef Stew",
  "description": "A classic, simple beef stew recipe made with potatoes and carrots that my grandmother developed and that is now being enjoyed by a fourth generation in my family. Delicious with salad and a crusty bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Martha Schrenk"
